\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   Jesus is come, 
\par there is cause for rejoicing!
\par From the beginning, 
\par forever He lives.
\par God joined with mankind, 
\par their praises are voicing;
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\fs16\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0\fs24 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\qj Joy to the world to creation He gives.\cf1 
\par \cf0 Heaven and earth send 
\par the glad proclamation:
\par Jesus is come, now rejoice, 
\par all creation!
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0\qj 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 2.  Jesus is come, 
\par we are free from the fetters!
\par Death and its power like bonds torn in twain.
\par Jesus, our Saviour,  
\par has  paid  off  all debtors;
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0\fs24 
\par By His atonement we freedom attain.
\par Raising us out of our 
\par sins our sorrow;
\par Jesus is come, 
\par there's a brighter tomorrow.
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0\qj 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Jesus is come as the 
\par fountain of mercy.
\par All who are thirsty may drink if they will.
\par Over all bonds of this 
\par earth gain the vict'ry,
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\fs16\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0\fs24 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\qj Finding compassion, 
\par partake to their fill.
\par Here may the soul be refreshed 
\par and bathe freely;
\par Jesus is come as the fountain of mercy.\f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

